{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["Our daughters you shall give [us], and our daughters you shall take for yourselves — they framed the intermarriage to the sons of Yaakov as honoring them — to give and to take, but when they reported the matter to the men of their city they said it in reverse, to honor the sons of the city — that they would be the takers and the givers, so as to entice them to comply and be circumcised."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:10.505859723Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}